# Nori rumah outfit

When adding or replacing a clip in `Resources/characters/nori-rumah/`, follow `artwork/home-routines/outfit.md`.

- Top: opaque cream tank top only, hem at the waist.
- Below the hem: bare legs and bare feet. No leggings, shorts, pants, skirt, or a longer tunic.
- Reference `Resources/characters/nori-rumah/home_sleeping/00.png`, not the sports character.
- Keep the approved sleep, idle, tea, reading, eating, and waking frames unless the user asks to replace them.
